    date: '2026-07-15',
    note: `Temperament: two-piece primitivism as a creed — nothing that isn't essential, the first three chords anyone learns played with feral conviction. Red-white-black minimalism as an arrangement rule. Roots span the duo's whole record collection (Delta blues to bubblegum to vaudeville), mixable pairwise to triangulate specific songs.`
